---
description: SEO requirements for tool, guide, and hub pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro,src/layouts/**/*.astro,src/data/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- One H1, unique title (≤60 chars final `<title>`) and meta description (50–165).
- Self-referencing canonical via `BaseLayout` / `ToolLayout` using `absoluteUrl()` / `PUBLIC_SITE_URL` (never hardcode hosts; never `example.com`).
- `og:image` absolute URL must not end with `/`.
- Tool pages: answer-first intro (40–60 words), visible Hammad author byline, FAQPage (3–6), topical guide links, converter above the fold; 600+ words in `tools.ts`.
- Guides: ~1000+ words (audit ≥800), FAQPage, author/dateModified, topical tools only + guide↔guide links.
- JSON-LD must match visible content; Person `@id` `https://github.com/hammadiqbal6#person`; no fake ratings.
- Follow `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md` — no duplicate primary intent.
- Governing playbook: `docs/SEO-PLAYBOOK.md`. Hard indexing rules: `docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md`. Domain cutover: `docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md`.
